[center][size=6][b]Universal Cyrillic Display Font for Nightwater[/b][/size][/center]

[center]A standalone font patch for Nightwater.[/center]

[hr]

[b]What this mod does[/b]

This mod adds a bold, readable Cyrillic set to the game's display font while keeping the original visual character of the Latin alphabet. It is intended for players and localization projects that want Cyrillic text to look closer to the game's original display style.

[b]Cyrillic coverage[/b]

The included glyph set covers the core alphabets used by Bulgarian, Russian, Ukrainian, Belarusian, Serbian and Macedonian text. It is suitable for other localizations as long as they use the included Unicode characters; it is not a complete replacement for every extended Cyrillic language.

[b]Important[/b]

[list]
[*]This is a font-only mod. It does not include a translation or change the selected language.
[*]It works with English and other installed languages, including community translations that use the included Cyrillic characters.
[*]The Bulgarian Localization mod already includes this font. Do not install both packages together.
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]

Extract the archive into the game's main folder, so the result is:

[code]SkylandsForaging\Content\Paks\SkylandsForaging-Font_P.pak[/code]

No launch parameter is required. Select the language you want in-game, then start the game normally.

[b]Credits and license[/b]

The modified font combines the game's original display font with Cyrillic glyphs from Playpen Sans ExtraBold. The package includes the applicable third-party notices and license text. Please keep these files with the mod when redistributing it.

[hr]

[center][size=3]A community-made font patch for better Cyrillic readability.[/size][/center]
